@Kitchain_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

GET {{Kitchain_Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: text/plain

### Published venues (fictional samples only when explicitly seeded)
GET {{Kitchain_Api_HostAddress}}/api/courts?city=Makati&indoorOutdoor=Indoor&amenity=Parking&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### One published development venue
GET {{Kitchain_Api_HostAddress}}/api/courts/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
Accept: application/json

### Approximate starting price cap in PHP
GET {{Kitchain_Api_HostAddress}}/api/courts?maxStartingPrice=450&currencyCode=PHP&minCourts=4
Accept: application/json

### Invalid pagination returns 400
GET {{Kitchain_Api_HostAddress}}/api/courts?pageSize=101
Accept: application/problem+json

###
GET {{Kitchain_Api_HostAddress}}/health/ready
Accept: text/plain
